        "id": "R-accessibility-1",
        "line": 11,
        "location": "src/components/Toolbar.tsx:13-15",
        "raisedBy": [
          "accessibility"
        ],
        "recommendation": "Render the delete action as a native `<button type=\"button\" className=\"icon-button\" onClick={onDelete}>`. The `div` has no role, no `tabindex` and no key handler: a keyboard user pressing Tab never lands on it, and Enter or Space cannot trigger it, so the only way to delete a document from its page — the purpose of the change — is a mouse click. A button is focusable, operable with Enter and Space, and exposes the role \"button\". WCAG 2.1.1 Keyboard, 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value.",
        "reported": true,
        "role": "accessibility",
        "severity": "high",
        "status": "open",
        "step": "code.review",
        "title": "Delete action is a clickable div, unreachable by keyboard"
      },
      {
        "awaiting": "author",
